 CHI(2) = BETA*2PI/V

 BETA AND CHI(2) IN A.U.:    [BETA] = M**(-1/2) L**(7/2) T
                             [CHI(2)] = 1/F
                             (L=LENGTH, M=MASS, T=TIME, F=FIELD INTENSITY)

 ELECTRIC SUSCEPTIBILITY IN THE SECOND HARMONIC GENERATION (SHG) CONVENTION IS:
